cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "National Hydrologic Services - Post Processing Library (NHS_PostProcessing)"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-05-29
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/fuadyassin/NHS_PostProcessing
url: https://nhs-postprocessing.readthedocs.io/en/latest/
abstract: >
  A Python library to enable the National Hydrological Services of Canada to
  carry out post-processing operations quickly and efficiently. Provides tools
  for data processing and manipulation, streamflow prediction model performance
  evaluation, model diagnostics, multi-model evaluations, and data visualizations.
